===Verb prefix===
{{rfc-header|Verb prefix}}
'''за-''' (za-)

# [[behind]], [[beyond]]
#:* {{Cyrl|[[идти|идти́]]}} — ''to go''
#:* {{Cyrl|[[заходить|зайти́]]}} — ''to go behind, to go beyond; to call on''
# to [[begin]] doing
#:* {{Cyrl|[[говорить|говори́ть]]}} — ''to speak''
#:* {{Cyrl|[[заговорить|заговори́ть]]}} — ''to begin to speak''
# with reflexive [[-ся]], to do [[with abandon]]
#:* {{Cyrl|[[заговориться|заговори́ться]]}} — ''to spout nonsense; to rattle on; to have a long talk with, forgetting the time''

